                                                "sense_id": "b8740a77-fc70-3daa-a012-dd601a0128b0",
                                                "text": "Wolferton was an important station on the Kings Lynn-Hunstanton line, which closed in 1969. As the station was convenient for the Sandringham estate, it was regularly patronised by royalty, and royal retiring rooms were provided."
                                            }
                                        ]
